
# Student Marks Management System

## About
A beginner-level Python project that calculates student marks and grades.

## Features
- Enter student name
- Enter subject names and marks
- Calculate total marks
- Calculate average percentage
- Automatically assign grades

## Python Concepts Used
- Variables
- While Loops
- If, Elif and Else
- Break Statements
- User Input
- Basic Calculations

## Language
Python 3

